[I] Mobile broadband settings for different service providers

[T] This package contains mobile broadband settings for different service
[T] providers in different countries. The Package contains only informational
[T] files so it's safe for distributions to grab updates even during feature
[T] freeze and maintenance stages.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mobile-broadband-provider-info

